'''Haxorus''' (Japanese: '''オノノクス''' ''Ononokus'') is a {{ct|Dragon}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Shine}} expansion.

