==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Haxorus|156}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-B}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Brilliant Stars|Haxorus|112}} from the {{TCG|Brilliant Stars}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Haxorus}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

